'''Blue Elite''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Elite Gamepass]] during the [[Christmas Event 2017]] in order to promote and convince players to buy it. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is astronaut blue in color with a dark skull imprinted in the center. The guard and handle are solid black.

==Trivia == 
*This is a variant of the [[Elite]] Knife, the other one being [[Green Elite]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Elite Set|Elite Set]].

